// Wizard Mizgog's amulets of accuracy: cache 786's inv 602, one slot (void-634's
// mizgogs_amulets_of_accuracy, 30 amulets). "Buy up to 30 amulets per day"
// (2011 wiki, Imp Catcher, 2011-05-16). Whether that is per player or per world
// has no source. Here the world's shop holds 30 and restocks one every 4800
// ticks, a day's worth spread over the 30.
